            "components": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Repository roles are cumulative. **Read** can view and clone, **Triage** can manage issues and pull requests without writing code, **Write** can push code, **Maintain** can manage many settings, and **Admin** has full control. Apply least privilege and reserve Admin for trusted owners."
              },
