                    "minLength": 80,
                    "defaultValue": "# Security Policy\n\n## Supported versions\n\nSecurity updates are provided for the current major version of inventory-api.\n\n## Reporting a vulnerability\n\nReport suspected vulnerabilities through GitHub private vulnerability reporting or the Contoso Labs internal security mailbox. Do not open public issues for suspected vulnerabilities."
